        <mxCell id="p28" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;" value="Here k = 11 and o = 1, so n = 17. Each dataIdentifier is echoed immediately before its own dataRecord, and the dataRecord lengths differ per DID (Table 144)."><mxGeometry x="20" y="416" width="920" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p29" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;" value="If the assembled response would not fit the transport protocol, the server answers NRC 0x14 responseTooLong instead (Table 146)."><mxGeometry x="20" y="434" width="920" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

